{"synopsis":"Artist yang sama dengan komik The Novels Extra\nYoo Sanghyun yang pernah menjadi juara termuda di kompetisi panahan nasional\ndan bakat yang amat menjanjikanmenyaksikan mimpinya hancur karena kecelakaan tragis yang membuatnya tidak bisa menggunakan busur lagi\nSekarang sebagai prodigy yang gagal dia menghadapi rintangan tambahan yaitu pemecatan dari perusahaan tempat dia bekerja\nAgar bisa mendapatkan uang dia berperan sebagai Almond dan menempuh jalan yang baru sebagai game streamer\nAnda telah memilih busur panah\nSwish Thud Headshot\nApa boss monster memang bisa dikalahkan dalam satu shot\nSekali lagi bakatnya yang amat mengesankan bersinar 28 tahun\nLulusan SMA Pengangguran Spesialisasi archery\nKembali sebagai genius streamer dia menempuh perjalanan pemberontakan yang menarik","alternative_title":"천재 궁수의 스트리밍","author":"Mung Mung Kim","artist":"Carrotoon","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c5630388-c24e-4e66-b36f-112164b6c20f","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b04617c0-a0b1-4772-9585-6412e48ef51e","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"461ad4d3-4a5d-4db4-b952-967559907a3a","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"acd3131c-b06b-4499-86fd-66067529f0b7","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"838a7ff0-8511-4cda-bc77-0d934d566322","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2920b5df-88c5-4c47-8ad1-5c2b03ef387a","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"126b885b-68b1-4d6d-b045-d243dc79df29","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026